{
 "name": "M21-1, Part X, Subpart iv, Chapter 1, Section F  - Reversal of Prior Determinations Related to Character of Discharge (COD), Line of Duty (LOD), or Willful Misconduct",
 "content": "<p style=\"text-align: right\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000177989\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part X, Subpart iv, Chapter 1, Section E  - Processing Cases Involving Common Accidents in Service\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000177989?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">&lt;-- Previous Section</a>&nbsp; <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000177991\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part X, Subpart iv, Chapter 2, Section A  - Insanity Determinations\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000177991?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">Next Section --&gt;</a></span></span></p><h2><a id=\"Top\" name=\"Top\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Overview</span></strong></span></a></h2><div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></div><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><div><hr /></div></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">In This Section</span></span></strong></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">This section contains the topic \u201c<a href=\"#1\">Reversal of Prior Determinations Related to COD, LOD, or Willful Misconduct</a>.\u201d</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><div><hr /></div></div><div></div><h2><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">1<a id=\"1\" name=\"1\">.</a>&nbsp; Reversal of Prior Determinations Related to COD, LOD, or Willful Misconduct</span></span></h2><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span><br />&nbsp;</p><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Introduction</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">This topic contains information about reversal of prior decisions, such as</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><a href=\"#1a\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">authorization activity jurisdiction in clear and unmistakable error (CUE) cases that sever service connection (SC)</span></span></a></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><a href=\"#1b\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">preparing the rating decision</span></span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">, and</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><a href=\"#1c\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">handling cases of disagreement between the authorization and rating activities</span></span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Change Date</span></span></strong></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">August 1, 2006</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">X.iv.1.F.1.a<a id=\"1a\" name=\"1a\">.</a>&nbsp; Authorization Activity Jurisdiction in CUE Cases That Sever SC</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Prepare an administrative decision if the authorization activity, rather than the rating activity</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">has initial jurisdiction of a</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">statutory bar to benefits and character-of-discharge (COD) determination under <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000177986\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part X, Subpart iv, Chapter 1, Section A  - Character of Discharge (COD) and Bars to Benefits\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000177986?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">M21-1, Part X, Subpart iv, 1.A</a> and <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000178524\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part X, Subpart iv, Chapter 1, Section B  - Special Topics Involving Character of Discharge\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000178524?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">B</a></span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">line-of-duty (LOD) determination under <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000177987\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part X, Subpart iv, Chapter 1, Section C  - Willful Misconduct and Line of Duty (LOD)\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000177987?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">M21-1, Part X, Subpart iv, 1.C.6</a>, or</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">willful misconduct determination under </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000177987\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part X, Subpart iv, Chapter 1, Section C  - Willful Misconduct and Line of Duty (LOD)\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000177987?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">M21-1, Part X, Subpart iv, 1.C.1-3</a></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">, and</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">finds that there is a clear and unmistakable error (CUE) in a prior determination which will result in the severance of service connection (SC).&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong><em>Note</em></strong>:&nbsp; The decision must contain a summary of findings and a statement as to the specific CUE that was identified.&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t<div></div>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong><em>References</em></strong>:&nbsp; For more information on</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">the preparation and approval of administrative decisions, see <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000177999\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part X, Subpart v, Chapter 1, Section C  - Administrative Decisions\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000177999?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">M21-1, Part X, Subpart v, 1.C.2 and 3</a>, and</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">CUE, see <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000177973\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part X, Subpart ii, Chapter 5, Section C - Due Process and Authorization Issues for Clear and Unmistakable Error (CUE)\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000177973?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">M21-1, Part X, Subpart ii, 5.C</a>.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">X.iv.1.F.1.b<a id=\"1b\" name=\"1b\">.</a>&nbsp; Preparing the Rating Decision</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Refer the claims folder, if in order, to the rating activity for appropriate action.&nbsp; This includes the preparation of a rating decision proposing the severance of&nbsp;SC under<a href=\"http://www.ecfr.gov/cgi-bin/text-idx?SID=b48183cdf37b555e5e7eadadf3c2314e&amp;node=se38.1.3_1105&amp;rgn=div8\" target=\"_blank\"> 38 CFR 3.105(c)</a> and <a href=\"http://www.ecfr.gov/cgi-bin/text-idx?SID=b48183cdf37b555e5e7eadadf3c2314e&amp;node=se38.1.3_1105&amp;rgn=div8\" target=\"_blank\">38 CFR 3.105(d)</a> on the basis of the determination by the authorization activity.</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">X.iv.1.F.1.c<a id=\"1c\" name=\"1c\">.</a>&nbsp; Handling Cases of Disagreement Between the Authorization and Rating Activities</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Refer the case by memorandum to the Veterans Service Center Manager for resolution of an issue if the rating activity disagrees with the determination by the authorization activity as to COD, LOD, or willful misconduct.</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><p style=\"text-align: right\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000177989\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part X, Subpart iv, Chapter 1, Section E  - Processing Cases Involving Common Accidents in Service\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000177989?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">&lt;-- Previous Section</a>&nbsp; <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000177991\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part X, Subpart iv, Chapter 2, Section A  - Insanity Determinations\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000177991?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">Next Section --&gt;</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a href=\"#top\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\">To Top</span></a></span></p>",
